/* 荒野与近郊暗线剧本库 / 沉船·森林废墟·花房·天鹅绒·风车·暗渠 / 多阶段差分 */

:: MP Quest Beach Shipwreck [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestShipwreck or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Sea Rocks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Sea Rocks">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	趁着潮水退去，你踩着湿滑的礁石走到那截覆满藤壶的旧船肋木旁。海浪拍打着空洞的船壳，发出低沉的呜咽声。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:07)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<pass 7>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestShipwreck_stg_1")>><<if "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 1>>
	你用随身工具刮去船壳表面厚重的牡蛎壳，辨认出船首像下方模糊的『白鸥号』字样，那是三十年前在雾角灯塔外失踪的商船。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:09)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 2>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<pass 9>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestShipwreck_stg_2")>><<if "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	顺着倾斜的甲板裂口向船舱内部窥探，你看到泥沙掩埋的底层舱门被一根断裂的铁锚链卡住了。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你屏息仔细摸索。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:12)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 3>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<pass 12>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestShipwreck_stg_3")>><<if "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 3>>
	你深吸一口气钻入半淹水的底舱，借着礁石缝隙透入的天光，用力撬开了那道变形的木门。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>>你手法干净利落。<<else>>你隔着衣袖操作。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:15)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 4>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<pass 15>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestShipwreck_stg_4")>><<if "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 4>>
	在船长室腐朽的红木书桌抽屉里，你摸到了一个用油布层层包裹的防水黄铜圆筒。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 500>>你迅速理清了脉络。<<else>>你默记下关键方位。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:18)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 5>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<pass 18>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestShipwreck_stg_5")>><<if "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	打开黄铜圆筒，里面保存着一份完好的航海星盘与一张标示着海蚀洞暗礁航线的旧海图。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($pain or 0) gte 20>>你忍痛探入暗格。<<else>>你蹲身取出证物。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:21)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 6>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<pass 21>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestShipwreck_stg_6")>><<if "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 6>>
	你在涨潮海水漫过礁石前带着航海星盘与海图安全返回了岸边。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($exposed or 0) gte 1>>你借着阴影遮体。<<else>>你从容收好物证。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:25)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestShipwreck to 1>><<pass 25>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestShipwreck_stg_7")>><<if "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestShipwreck" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg gte 7>>
	『退潮暗礁间的沉船肋木』的每一处秘密都已向你敞开，你站在这里只觉心旷神怡。
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[原路返回 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Resolve [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Sea Rocks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Sea Rocks">>
<</if>>
趁着涨潮的海浪重新漫过暗礁，你抱紧从沉船肋木夹层里起出的防水铜匣，踩着浅水退回干燥的礁石高处。
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>海面风雨交加，咸涩的浪花拍打在礁石上溅起层层白沫。<<else>>海风吹干了你袖口的海水，远处的海平线一片澄澈。<</if>>
这艘三十年前触礁的远洋货轮，终于将它吞没的秘密交到了你手里。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[在原地复查细节 (0:03)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[带着收获返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

