<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Park">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	你绕到公园偏僻处的旧玻璃花房侧门旁。几块破裂的玻璃窗用木板钉着，但门缝里依然源源不断地飘出那股令人微醺的甜香。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:07)|MP Quest Park Greenhouse Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestGreenhouse to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestGreenhouse to 1>><<pass 7>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestGreenhouse_stg_1")>><<if "mpQuestGreenhouse" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestGreenhouse" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 1>>
	你轻轻拨开侧门虚挂的铁链闪身进入花房。温热潮湿的空气里，几株叶片泛着银光的奇异兰花正在阴影中静静绽放。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续探索 (0:09)|MP Quest Park Greenhouse Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestGreenhouse to 2>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestGreenhouse to 1>><<pass 9>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestGreenhouse_stg_2")>><<if "mpQuestGreenhouse" is "mpQuestUnderground" or "mpQuestGreenhouse" is "mpQuestVelvet">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	你在花房的工作台上发现了一本字迹娟秀的培育手记，上面记载着这种『夜雾兰』只会在黄昏至午夜分泌具有安神与催情双重效用的花蜜。
